#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:1
msgid "FlexDesigner SDK"
msgstr "FlexDesigner SDK"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:3
msgid ""
"A comprehensive SDK for developing plugins for FlexDesigner, providing "
"seamless integration with Flexbar devices and rich interaction capabilities."
msgstr ""
"FlexDesigner 向けプラグイン開発のための包括的な SDK で、Flexbar との連携と多彩なインタラクション機能を提供します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "インストール"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:7
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:9
msgid "Node.js version 20 or higher"
msgstr "Node.js 20 以降"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:10
msgid "FlexDesigner version 1.0.0 or higher."
msgstr "FlexDesigner 1.0.0 以降。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:12
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "設定"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:14
msgid "Add FlexDesigner SDK to your project"
msgstr "FlexDesigner SDK をプロジェクトに追加する"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:16
msgid ""
"In typical cases, you only need to create a plugin project using `flexcli`, "
"and the FlexDesigner SDK will be automatically installed."
msgstr ""
"通常は `flexcli` でプラグイン プロジェクトを作成するだけで、FlexDesigner SDK が自動的にインストールされます。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:22
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "クイックスタート"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:41
msgid "Core Concepts"
msgstr "主要な概念"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:43
msgid "Plugin Lifecycle"
msgstr "プラグインのライフサイクル"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:45
msgid "**Initialization**: Plugin starts and connects to FlexDesigner"
msgstr "**初期化**: プラグインが起動し、FlexDesigner に接続します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:46
msgid "**Alive Event**: Triggered when keys are loaded and ready"
msgstr "**Alive イベント**: キーが読み込まれ、操作可能になったときに発火します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:47
msgid "**Data Events**: Triggered when users interact with keys"
msgstr "**データ イベント**: ユーザーがキーを操作したときに発火します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:48
msgid "**Configuration**: Plugin can read/write configuration data"
msgstr "**設定**: プラグインは設定データの読み書きができます。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:50
msgid "Key Types"
msgstr "キーの種類"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:52
msgid "**Standard Keys**: Basic button functionality"
msgstr "**標準キー**: 基本的なボタン機能"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:53
msgid "**Multi-State Keys**: Cycle through different states"
msgstr "**マルチステート キー**: 複数の状態を切り替えます。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:54
msgid "**Slider Keys**: Continuous value adjustment"
msgstr "**スライダー キー**: 連続値調整"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:55
msgid "**Dynamic Keys**: Dynamically managed key collections"
msgstr "**ダイナミック キー**: 動的に管理するキーの集合です。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:56
msgid "**Wheel Keys**: Rotary encoder support"
msgstr "**ホイール キー**: ロータリー エンコーダーのサポート"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:58
msgid "API Reference"
msgstr "API リファレンス"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:60
msgid "Built-in Modules"
msgstr "組み込みモジュール"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:62
msgid ""
"To simplify the plugin development process, we have pre-integrated several "
"modules that can be used directly:"
msgstr "プラグイン開発を簡単にするため、すぐに使えるモジュールをあらかじめ組み込んでいます。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:64
msgid "[@napi-rs/canvas](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@napi-rs/canvas)"
msgstr "[@napi-rs/canvas](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@napi-rs/canvas)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:65
msgid "[express](https://www.npmjs.com/package/express)"
msgstr "[express](https://www.npmjs.com/package/express)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:66
msgid "[axios](https://www.npmjs.com/package/axios)"
msgstr "[axios](https://www.npmjs.com/package/axios)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:68
msgid "If you need integration of other modules, please let us know"
msgstr "他のモジュールの組み込みが必要な場合はお知らせください。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:70
msgid "Core Plugin APIs"
msgstr "コア プラグイン API"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:72
msgid "plugin.start()"
msgstr "plugin.start()"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:74
msgid "Starts the WebSocket connection and initializes the plugin."
msgstr "WebSocket 接続を開始し、プラグインを初期化します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:80
msgid "plugin.on(event, handler)"
msgstr "plugin.on(event, handler)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:82
msgid "Registers an event handler for specific events."
msgstr "指定したイベントのハンドラーを登録します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:84
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:111
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:133
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:148
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:164
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:184
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:208
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:340
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:375
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:408
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**パラメータ:**"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:86
msgid "`event` (string): Event type"
msgstr "`event` (文字列): イベントの種類"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:87
msgid "`handler` (function): Event handler function"
msgstr "`handler` (関数): イベントハンドラー関数"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:97
msgid "plugin.off(event)"
msgstr "plugin.off(event)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:99
msgid "Unregisters an event handler."
msgstr "イベント ハンドラーの登録を解除します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:105
msgid "Drawing and Visual Updates"
msgstr "描画と表示の更新"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:107
msgid "plugin.draw(serialNumber, key, type?, base64?)"
msgstr "plugin.draw(serialNumber, key, type?, base64?)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:109
msgid "Updates the visual appearance of a key."
msgstr "キーの見た目を更新します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:113
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:135
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:150
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:166
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:186
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:210
msgid "`serialNumber` (string): Device serial number"
msgstr "`serialNumber` (文字列): デバイスのシリアル番号"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:114
msgid "`key` (object): Key object from events"
msgstr "`key` (オブジェクト): イベントからのキーオブジェクト"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:115
msgid "`type` (string): 'draw' (default) or 'base64'"
msgstr "`type` (文字列): 'draw' (デフォルト) または 'base64'"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:116
msgid "`base64` (string): Base64 image data (when type is 'base64')"
msgstr "`base64` (文字列): Base64画像データ(型が'base64'の場合)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:127
msgid "Key State Management"
msgstr "キー状態の管理"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:129
msgid "plugin.setMultiState(serialNumber, key, state, message?)"
msgstr "plugin.setMultiState(serialNumber, key, state, message?)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:131
msgid "Sets the state for multi-state keys."
msgstr "マルチステートキーの状態を設定します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:136
#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:151
msgid "`key` (object): Key object"
msgstr "`key` (オブジェクト): キーオブジェクト"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:137
msgid "`state` (number): Target state index"
msgstr "`state` (数値): ターゲット状態インデックス"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:138
msgid "`message` (string, optional): Display message"
msgstr "`message` (string, 任意): 表示するメッセージ"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:144
msgid "plugin.setSlider(serialNumber, key, value)"
msgstr "plugin.setSlider(serialNumber, key, value)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:146
msgid "Sets the value for slider keys."
msgstr "スライダー キーの値を設定します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:152
msgid "`value` (number): Slider value"
msgstr "`value` (数値): スライダーの値"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:158
msgid "Device Configuration & Control"
msgstr "デバイス設定と制御"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:160
msgid "plugin.sendControlCommand(serialNumber, command)"
msgstr "plugin.sendControlCommand(serialNumber, command)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:162
msgid "Sends control commands to the device"
msgstr "デバイスに制御コマンドを送信します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:167
msgid "`command` (string): The command to send. One of the following:"
msgstr "`command` (文字列): 送信するコマンド。次のいずれか:"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:168
msgid "\"sys.sleep\": Put the device to sleep"
msgstr "\"sys.sleep\": デバイスをスリープ状態にします。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:169
msgid "\"sys.wake\": Wake up the device"
msgstr "\"sys.wake\": デバイスをスリープから復帰させます。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:170
msgid "\"haptic.click\": Trigger a click vibration"
msgstr "\"haptic.click\": クリックに相当する振動フィードバックを出します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:180
msgid "plugin.setDeviceConfig(serialNumber, config)"
msgstr "plugin.setDeviceConfig(serialNumber, config)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:182
msgid "Configures device settings."
msgstr "デバイスの設定を行います。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:187
msgid "`config` (object): Configuration object"
msgstr "`config` (オブジェクト): 設定オブジェクト"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:202
msgid "Messaging and Notifications"
msgstr "メッセージと通知"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:204
msgid ""
"plugin.showFlexbarSnackbarMessage(serialNumber, msg, level, icon?, timeout?,"
" waitUser?)"
msgstr ""
"plugin.showFlexbarSnackbarMessage(serialNumber, msg, level, icon?, timeout?,"
" waitUser?)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:206
msgid "Displays a message on the Flexbar device."
msgstr "Flexbar デバイスにメッセージを表示します。"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:211
msgid "`msg` (string): Message content (max 64 characters)"
msgstr "`msg` (文字列): メッセージの内容 (最大 64 文字)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:212
msgid ""
"`level` (string): Message level ('info', 'warning', 'error', 'success')"
msgstr "`level` (文字列): メッセージ レベル ('info'、'warning'、'error'、'success')"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:213
msgid "`icon` (string, optional): Icon name"
msgstr "`icon` (文字列、オプション): アイコン名"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:214
msgid ""
"`timeout` (number, optional): Duration in ms (500-10000, default: 2000)"
msgstr "`timeout` (数値、オプション): ミリ秒単位の継続時間 (500 ～ 10000、デフォルト: 2000)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:215
msgid "`waitUser` (boolean, optional): Wait for user interaction"
msgstr "`waitUser` (boolean, 任意): ユーザー操作を待つかどうか"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:227
msgid "plugin.showSnackbarMessage(color, message, timeout?)"
msgstr "plugin.showSnackbarMessage(color, message, timeout?)"

#: ../../source/sdk/sdk_api_reference.md:229
msgid "Shows a message in the FlexDesigner application."
msgstr "FlexDesigner アプリケーションにメッセージを表示します。"

